abstract: >
  The Unified Model is a modular, cross-domain regulatory architecture describing
  the interactions between autonomic, cognitive, interoceptive, metabolic, immune,
  neuromodulatory, and social systems. This release provides the initial stable
  specification, including the Minimal Core and a full set of bidirectional
  subsystem contracts.
